00:02:12.175 --> 00:02:14.406
I wouldn't have left the funeral
if it wasn't serious.


00:02:14.577 --> 00:02:15.340
What's going on?


00:02:15.612 --> 00:02:20.176
I'll be there soon,
so sit tight with your hubby.


00:02:20.684 --> 00:02:22.744
So much for passing off
as a good son.


00:02:23.254 --> 00:02:24.119
Just get here quick!


00:02:25.089 --> 00:02:26.387
How's Mina?
What's she doing?


00:02:27.258 --> 00:02:28.317
Your kid's fine!


00:02:29.126 --> 00:02:31.027
Hey... sis...


00:02:35.099 --> 00:02:37.330
What a fucking day!


00:02:47.044 --> 00:02:48.603
That fucking mutt...


00:03:31.856 --> 00:03:33.222
Hey mister.


00:03:35.794 --> 00:03:36.955
Mister.


00:03:43.702 --> 00:03:44.863
Hey!


00:04:14.632 --> 00:04:15.656
Goddammit!


00:04:18.803 --> 00:04:20.466
EMERGENCY CALL


00:04:22.675 --> 00:04:23.370
SISTER


00:04:26.412 --> 00:04:27.209
Yeah, what?


00:04:27.813 --> 00:04:30.305
Daddy! Whatcha doing?


00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:31.845
Hey Mina... Sweetie...


00:04:32.418 --> 00:04:33.818
- Did you buy the cake?
- What?


00:04:34.754 --> 00:04:35.585
Huh? What?
Yeah, that...


00:04:35.654 --> 00:04:37.748
You promised,
a chocolate cake!


00:04:38.491 --> 00:04:41.655
Right, a chocolate cake.


00:04:42.328 --> 00:04:43.261
Did buy it yet?


00:04:45.531 --> 00:04:47.124
- Daddy?
- Sweetie...


00:04:47.233 --> 00:04:48.792
I'll call you back!


00:05:26.406 --> 00:05:27.567
Dammit...


00:06:48.656 --> 00:06:49.589
Jesus Christ...


00:07:07.942 --> 00:07:09.740
Evening.
DUl checkpoint, sir.


00:07:13.514 --> 00:07:15.676
- DUl check.
- Evening, officer.


00:07:17.351 --> 00:07:18.614
I...


00:07:20.588 --> 00:07:24.959
I'm Western District Homicide
Det. Ko Gun-su...


00:07:25.627 --> 00:07:27.357
Northern District
officer Lee Dong-yun.


00:07:27.529 --> 00:07:29.589
I see, thanks for your work.


00:07:30.399 --> 00:07:31.890
Keep at it,
thanks bud.


00:07:32.734 --> 00:07:34.635
Could you blow into this?


00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.197
What?


00:07:36.672 --> 00:07:37.867
You drank? Didn't you?


00:07:41.743 --> 00:07:42.759
You did.


00:07:42.811 --> 00:07:45.747
It's my mother's funeral,
so I had a drink.


00:07:47.049 --> 00:07:48.779
Can't you let me off the hook?


00:07:49.351 --> 00:07:50.444
Give it a blow please.


00:07:51.587 --> 00:07:53.488
My mother passed away.


00:07:57.059 --> 00:07:58.357
I see,
one moment please.


00:07:59.728 --> 00:08:01.663
- Officer Lee!
- Yeah, one sec.


00:08:20.983 --> 00:08:22.247
Get out of the car!


00:08:23.052 --> 00:08:24.452
Get out of the car now!


00:08:24.621 --> 00:08:25.520
What is it?


00:08:25.955 --> 00:08:27.685
He attempted to flee the scene.


00:08:28.024 --> 00:08:29.424
Are you deaf?


00:08:35.665 --> 00:08:36.826
Evening, officer!


00:08:37.867 --> 00:08:40.598
I'm Western District Homicide
Det. Ko.


00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:44.534
I had a sip
at my mother's funeral...


00:08:44.674 --> 00:08:45.733
Couldn't I get a pass?


00:08:46.042 --> 00:08:48.102
No ID, and he was
acting suspicious.


00:08:48.544 --> 00:08:49.944
Officer Lee,
come on, man.


00:08:50.046 --> 00:08:51.105
What's your ID number?


00:08:52.882 --> 00:08:55.750
Come on, we're all cops here.


00:08:56.085 --> 00:08:58.145
So what's your ID number?


00:09:05.862 --> 00:09:08.923
760625-12653172


00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.468
There's an extra number.


00:09:12.735 --> 00:09:13.896
What?


00:09:14.003 --> 00:09:17.030
There are 14 numbers,
ID consists of 13.


00:09:19.575 --> 00:09:21.407
- Write it down properly.
- I am sir.


00:09:23.213 --> 00:09:24.806
It's... 760625-1265...


00:09:24.915 --> 00:09:27.714
Let's check with the database
in my car.


00:09:27.818 --> 00:09:30.686
What for?
We're doing that right now.


00:09:30.788 --> 00:09:32.086
Call my district and verify!


00:09:32.189 --> 00:09:33.782
It'll be simpler that way.


00:09:33.891 --> 00:09:36.019
Let's get it over with...
Hey, hey!


00:09:36.126 --> 00:09:38.857
- Don't touch my car!
- You had an accident.


00:09:38.962 --> 00:09:40.555
- Call and verify!
- Back off, sir.


00:09:40.698 --> 00:09:42.758
Officer Choi, pop the trunk.


00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.124
Yes, sir.


00:09:44.802 --> 00:09:45.826
Hey! Stop it!


00:09:46.136 --> 00:09:50.130
Don't you dare!


00:09:51.175 --> 00:09:52.505
Let's just check the database...


00:09:52.557 --> 00:09:53.835
What do you think you're doing?!


00:09:53.944 --> 00:09:54.741
Grab him, grab him!


00:09:54.845 --> 00:09:56.609
Let go, you son of a bitch!


00:09:56.714 --> 00:09:58.546
Let go!


00:09:59.049 --> 00:09:59.948
Fucking bitches!


00:10:02.252 --> 00:10:03.845
Grab him, now!


00:10:13.564 --> 00:10:14.759
Incoming radio from HQ.


00:10:16.633 --> 00:10:17.532
Go ahead.


00:10:17.901 --> 00:10:20.996
The ID is verified,
he's a Western Det. Ko.


00:10:31.015 --> 00:10:35.817
How can you do this
to fellow cops, goddammit!


00:10:38.256 --> 00:10:39.485
Open this drawer.


00:10:40.091 --> 00:10:41.855
Why so many locks on this?


00:10:43.228 --> 00:10:44.093
Is Det. Ko here?


00:10:46.097 --> 00:10:47.622
He's mourning at the moment.


00:10:48.233 --> 00:10:49.201
Hammer.


00:10:51.569 --> 00:10:52.662
What's inside?


00:10:54.172 --> 00:10:55.504
He said to leave it.


00:10:55.573 --> 00:10:56.666
What?


00:10:57.609 --> 00:10:58.668
You know his temper.


00:10:59.844 --> 00:11:01.210
God-fucking-damn...


00:11:05.917 --> 00:11:07.283
- Thank you so much.
- Not at all, sir.


00:11:10.822 --> 00:11:11.846
You, come here.


00:11:12.190 --> 00:11:13.681
Mr. 14-digit, come here!


00:11:14.058 --> 00:11:15.253
Officer Shin Hyun-jin.


00:11:15.794 --> 00:11:16.887
Fuck...


00:11:23.636 --> 00:11:24.399
Buddy.


00:11:26.572 --> 00:11:28.564
- Don't talk back, okay?
- Yes, sir!


00:11:29.275 --> 00:11:31.039
- Watch it.
- Yes, sir!


00:11:37.917 --> 00:11:38.599
What?


00:11:38.651 --> 00:11:40.176
Sir, you should get
a designated driver...


00:11:41.086 --> 00:11:43.180
No problem, good night!


00:11:47.793 --> 00:11:50.319
Yo 14-digit!
It's all your fault!


00:11:50.629 --> 00:11:52.120
Boys, that's enough!


00:11:58.304 --> 00:11:59.738
You're all fucked.


00:12:00.773 --> 00:12:02.742
What the hell happened here?!


00:12:09.782 --> 00:12:12.013
What brings you here
past midnight?


00:12:15.287 --> 00:12:18.917
You're accusing a mourner
over some money without context?


00:12:19.291 --> 00:12:20.987
IAD isn't run by humans?


00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.890
We're only following our orders.


00:12:22.995 --> 00:12:23.986
Ship out.


00:12:24.865 --> 00:12:25.798
Come back after the funeral.


00:12:26.333 --> 00:12:27.926
Don't just stand there,
pack up!


00:12:30.837 --> 00:12:32.066
This here is a list,


00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:37.177
of those who took bribes
from local businesses.


00:12:38.144 --> 00:12:39.976
I said pack up!


00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:40.943
Doh Hee-chul, $1,000,


00:12:41.948 --> 00:12:45.077
Choi Sang-ho, $3,500,
Ko Gun-su, $3,500,


00:12:45.986 --> 00:12:48.615
and over 10 grand...


00:12:51.324 --> 00:12:53.987
You're on a different level,
chief.


00:12:57.964 --> 00:13:00.160
DET. CHOl - RAIDED BY THE IAD.
ANSWER THE DAMN PHONE!


00:13:13.246 --> 00:13:14.270
SISTER


00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.313
What? What now?


00:13:21.888 --> 00:13:24.882
What's with you?!
What's taking so long?!


00:13:25.159 --> 00:13:27.128
Just let me be!


00:13:27.361 --> 00:13:30.126
Let you be?
Mom's getting prepped!


00:13:30.898 --> 00:13:33.299
We need you here!
Get here now!


00:13:37.271 --> 00:13:39.831
Fuck, everything's just perfect!


00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.009
Daddy, your foot!


00:14:22.249 --> 00:14:23.080
Hey, sweetie.


00:14:24.786 --> 00:14:26.002
Why aren't you sleeping?


00:14:26.054 --> 00:14:29.047
I already did.
Where's the cake?


00:14:29.891 --> 00:14:30.881
Sorry, I...


00:14:32.828 --> 00:14:34.854
I'll buy you next time, okay?


00:14:35.897 --> 00:14:37.297
Mina, I'm sorry.
I...


00:15:01.323 --> 00:15:03.121
Make room in the grave for us too.


00:15:03.592 --> 00:15:04.719
I'm sorry sir.


00:15:06.161 --> 00:15:06.992
Chief...


00:15:07.162 --> 00:15:10.826
I'm sorry,
but could we do this later?


00:15:11.433 --> 00:15:12.628
Yo, Ko Gun-su!


00:15:12.868 --> 00:15:17.033
Shouldn't you at least pretend to
take some responsibility for this?


00:15:18.573 --> 00:15:19.700
What?


00:15:26.115 --> 00:15:29.677
Wait...


00:15:30.953 --> 00:15:31.886
You want me to...


00:15:33.923 --> 00:15:35.323
take the heat for you all?


00:15:37.427 --> 00:15:38.690
While grieving?


00:15:40.596 --> 00:15:42.997
What a fucking timing!


00:15:44.267 --> 00:15:46.327
I'm sorry, we really are.


00:15:46.602 --> 00:15:50.198
But we all can't go down.
This should end with you.


00:15:50.406 --> 00:15:51.874
I'll take care of you,
so don't worry.


00:15:51.974 --> 00:15:54.569
Take care of me?!
Cover your own ass!


00:15:55.511 --> 00:15:57.309
You're not getting out of this!


00:15:58.281 --> 00:16:01.183
Even your brothel trips
are on record!


00:16:01.551 --> 00:16:03.042
'Ms. Autumn' is your regular, right?


00:16:03.186 --> 00:16:04.882
Motherfucker, are you nuts?!


00:16:05.054 --> 00:16:07.546
Yeah, fuckhead!
I wish I was mental!


00:16:07.924 --> 00:16:09.324
- Fuck you man!
- Come at me!


00:16:09.559 --> 00:16:11.460
- Hey, hey!
- Let's go!


00:16:13.096 --> 00:16:14.189
Gun-su!


00:16:16.566 --> 00:16:18.034
Mother's ready for casket.


00:16:31.882 --> 00:16:32.781
My condolences.


00:16:33.317 --> 00:16:34.683
Take care, sir.


00:16:40.157 --> 00:16:44.117
License plate 2644,
please move your car.


00:16:44.528 --> 00:16:46.190
It's designated for the hearse


00:16:46.497 --> 00:16:49.467
Please do not park there.


00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.231
The unit was raided,
couldn't even find an envelope.


00:16:55.906 --> 00:16:57.067
Give her a good send off.


00:17:34.479 --> 00:17:37.074
Insert any of her personal items
you'd like to put in.


00:17:44.088 --> 00:17:46.922
We'll hammer the nails
in this order.


00:17:51.362 --> 00:17:53.490
Mother!


00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:06.942
DET. NAM:
RATS ARE HEADING THERE


00:18:07.045 --> 00:18:09.071
MIGHT SEARCH THE CAR,
ANYTHING INSIDE?


00:18:16.454 --> 00:18:17.547
- Mr. Ko?
- Yes?


00:18:32.071 --> 00:18:36.509
License plate 2644,
please move your car.


00:18:51.023 --> 00:18:53.993
CHAPEL OF THE REST


00:19:10.209 --> 00:19:12.041
Where are you going?!


00:19:13.345 --> 00:19:14.313
Gun-su!


00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.053
What's that there?


00:19:23.622 --> 00:19:24.453
Isn't that Gun-su?


00:19:27.661 --> 00:19:28.424
What's with him?


00:19:29.496 --> 00:19:32.125
Chief, let's dig into the IAD guys.


00:19:33.500 --> 00:19:34.559
We need leverage.


00:19:35.535 --> 00:19:38.562
I doubt there's anything,
they're IAD after all.


00:19:40.507 --> 00:19:42.567
Come on, Internal Affairs is
still police.


00:19:44.311 --> 00:19:47.042
Don't overestimate Korean cops.


00:19:48.415 --> 00:19:49.383
Sir?


00:20:23.616 --> 00:20:28.248
Sir, I'd like some private moment
with my mother one last time.


00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:30.421
But...


00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.823
that's rather unusual.


00:20:35.796 --> 00:20:36.820
Okay.


00:20:37.865 --> 00:20:39.163
- Until midnight.
- Thank you.


00:20:48.242 --> 00:20:49.608
By the way,
what's that for?


00:20:51.679 --> 00:20:52.612
These are for my daughter.


00:20:53.681 --> 00:20:54.842
I see.


00:20:56.917 --> 00:20:58.146
Thank you again.


00:21:24.378 --> 00:21:25.209
I'm sorry, mom.


00:21:47.335 --> 00:21:49.361
EFFECTIVE RANGE: 3M


00:21:49.471 --> 00:21:50.370
Dammit!


00:22:20.302 --> 00:22:22.203
Holy fuck...


00:23:52.029 --> 00:23:53.088
Shit...


00:24:03.740 --> 00:24:06.642
I'm a terrible son,
I'll make it up to you...


00:24:20.090 --> 00:24:21.353
Anyone inside?


00:24:21.558 --> 00:24:22.526
Did you hear that,
just now?


00:24:23.894 --> 00:24:24.691
I'm not sure.


00:24:27.598 --> 00:24:28.999
Security 1, security 1.


00:24:31.436 --> 00:24:33.905
Yeah, this is the security office.


00:24:34.572 --> 00:24:37.371
Could you check something
on the security feed?


00:24:37.475 --> 00:24:41.412
I'm outside the chapel,
I got a report of disturbance.


00:24:43.581 --> 00:24:45.072
Huh?
What the heck?


00:24:48.753 --> 00:24:51.450
Can't see inside.
Have to go in and check.


00:24:51.823 --> 00:24:52.813
Is the key there?


00:24:53.691 --> 00:24:57.389
I'll ask the funeral director
to check it out now.


00:24:57.929 --> 00:24:59.898
Okay, thank you.


00:25:00.632 --> 00:25:02.567
Will you stay and wait?


00:25:02.767 --> 00:25:03.783
Not really.


00:25:03.835 --> 00:25:04.996
- Let's go then.
- Okay.


00:26:39.599 --> 00:26:40.897
Stay there!


00:26:50.043 --> 00:26:51.011
Thank you.


00:26:52.746 --> 00:26:54.715
Mom, I'll get him out soon.


00:26:55.181 --> 00:26:56.205
I'm so sorry.


00:28:00.214 --> 00:28:02.683
What the hell?


00:28:16.730 --> 00:28:18.130
Give me a break!


00:28:28.776 --> 00:28:29.836
Please, not yet!


00:28:30.612 --> 00:28:32.843
I'm begging you!


00:28:33.114 --> 00:28:35.982
Hang up! Please!
I'm so close!


00:28:38.153 --> 00:28:40.145
Mom, mom, please,
do something!


00:28:41.156 --> 00:28:43.591
Hang up! Hang up!
Please!


00:28:59.774 --> 00:29:01.743
It's time, Mr. Ko...


00:29:02.711 --> 00:29:03.371
Okay.


00:29:16.391 --> 00:29:17.381
- Mr. Ko?
- Yes?


00:30:02.104 --> 00:30:06.235
My Lord is always nearby...


00:30:11.314 --> 00:30:12.748
Why is this so heavy?


00:30:15.418 --> 00:30:17.751
Careful, go slowly.


00:30:22.158 --> 00:30:23.683
Mother...


00:30:31.435 --> 00:30:32.767
Mom, I'm sorry!


00:30:33.937 --> 00:30:34.961
I'll be back soon.


00:30:35.072 --> 00:30:37.234
What a great son.


00:30:40.344 --> 00:30:42.279
- Mother!
- Gun-su!


00:30:42.379 --> 00:30:43.745
Great son indeed.


00:30:46.249 --> 00:30:49.117
Gun-su, we should go now.


00:31:03.367 --> 00:31:04.027
Hey, hey!


00:31:04.935 --> 00:31:05.902
What's this?


00:31:05.954 --> 00:31:06.528
It's...


00:31:06.870 --> 00:31:09.465
Some bastard stole
her toy soldier!


00:31:09.773 --> 00:31:11.036
I'll snap that bastard's neck!


00:31:12.409 --> 00:31:16.346
She was wailing so I got it
from the hospital shop,


00:31:16.446 --> 00:31:17.141
it's not expensive.


00:31:17.547 --> 00:31:18.310
Hospital shop?


00:31:23.787 --> 00:31:25.255
It's pretty fast.


00:31:28.291 --> 00:31:30.886
Mina, that's enough,
I'm gonna get mad.


00:31:34.332 --> 00:31:36.130
IAD backed off quite easily.


00:31:36.501 --> 00:31:39.528
They confiscated the money
and called it quits.


00:31:40.238 --> 00:31:42.969
We all went to great lengths
to save your ass.


00:31:44.142 --> 00:31:45.508
We're the best, aren't we?


00:31:46.244 --> 00:31:47.974
Thank you,
I'll see you tomorrow.


00:31:49.213 --> 00:31:51.773
Okay, I understand.


00:32:30.588 --> 00:32:31.989
Mister, get out.


00:32:35.027 --> 00:32:35.960
Are you drunk?


00:32:36.929 --> 00:32:39.296
Good afternoon.
Western District Det. Ko.


00:32:41.166 --> 00:32:43.931
Why did you park
on a right-turn lane?


00:32:44.036 --> 00:32:54.035
You know better.


00:32:55.013 --> 00:32:59.007
This is a recently confiscated
homemade C4,


00:32:59.151 --> 00:33:01.120
the explosive yield is tremendous,


00:33:01.220 --> 00:33:03.621
and can be remotely detonated.


00:33:04.223 --> 00:33:08.092
So desperate to make an impression
on the new commissioner.


00:33:08.260 --> 00:33:09.319
Not too many reporters.


00:33:09.928 --> 00:33:12.864
It detonates 2 minutes after
pushing this button.


00:33:13.165 --> 00:33:15.100
We'll start the demonstration.


00:33:15.667 --> 00:33:17.533
DEMONSTRATION OF I.E.D.


00:33:18.370 --> 00:33:22.137
We'll also blow 4 societal evils
as part of our campaign


00:33:22.241 --> 00:33:23.231
with the bomb.


00:33:23.542 --> 00:33:24.635
Armed.


00:33:27.479 --> 00:33:28.580
Det. Ko's back.


00:33:28.632 --> 00:33:29.843
Afternoon.


00:33:30.215 --> 00:33:31.080
Sent her off well?


00:33:31.517 --> 00:33:32.300
Yes.


00:33:32.352 --> 00:33:33.183
It all worked out in the end.


00:33:34.020 --> 00:33:36.615
- An emotional turmoil, eh?
- Thanks to you.


00:33:38.291 --> 00:33:41.489
Don't be sarcastic,
Choi took care of the mess.


00:33:42.195 --> 00:33:43.390
Nice, eh?
You owe me a dinner.


00:33:44.697 --> 00:33:45.960
Fine.


00:33:47.100 --> 00:33:47.658
How's Ms. Autumn?


00:33:48.101 --> 00:33:49.660
Goddammit!


00:33:50.703 --> 00:33:52.467
Ask this fucker,
fucking newbie.


00:33:53.039 --> 00:33:56.066
Careful, they'll be
on your ass again soon.


00:33:56.609 --> 00:33:58.407
Looks like it'll go off now.


00:33:59.946 --> 00:34:01.539
Making a fuss
over some fireworks.


00:34:02.148 --> 00:34:03.446
Holy fuck!


00:34:04.384 --> 00:34:07.650
- That was huge!
- Someone's fucked.


00:34:09.189 --> 00:34:10.213
Holy shit!


00:34:10.690 --> 00:34:11.680
Chief, look...


00:34:12.425 --> 00:34:13.518
Isn't that your new car?


00:34:13.960 --> 00:34:15.019
Your Grandeur!


00:34:15.195 --> 00:34:17.926
Goddamn son of a bitch!


00:34:18.398 --> 00:34:19.388
They should've been more careful...


00:34:21.701 --> 00:34:23.329
Why isn't the key working?


00:34:24.237 --> 00:34:25.319
Here.


00:34:25.371 --> 00:34:26.387
What's this?


00:34:26.439 --> 00:34:28.931
Cold cases, and cases nearing
statute of limitations,


00:34:29.175 --> 00:34:30.302
we're told to focus on these.


00:34:30.577 --> 00:34:31.359
Why?


00:34:31.411 --> 00:34:33.176
Probably our punishment.


00:34:34.281 --> 00:34:35.374
Fuckers...


00:34:35.616 --> 00:34:37.084
Suit up!


00:34:37.718 --> 00:34:39.186
- We got a tip.
- What?


00:34:42.756 --> 00:34:43.621
Lee Gwang-min.


00:34:44.325 --> 00:34:46.351
The very definition of a killer's face.


00:34:50.264 --> 00:34:51.994
WANTED FOR MURDER


00:34:58.739 --> 00:34:59.536
- What are you doing?
- What?


00:35:00.608 --> 00:35:02.008
- Let's go!
- Okay.


00:35:25.366 --> 00:35:28.063
This fucker was a front for
bars and brothels,


00:35:28.235 --> 00:35:30.397
he's suspected of killing
2 of his competitors.


00:35:31.071 --> 00:35:33.268
This'll not only get us off the hook
but promotions too.


00:35:33.775 --> 00:35:36.540
If we get him, you cuff him,
I'll let you have this.


00:35:37.279 --> 00:35:38.372
I'm the best, eh?


00:35:57.299 --> 00:35:58.597
Fucking dog...


00:36:00.201 --> 00:36:02.466
Chief, maybe it was a prank call.


00:36:03.204 --> 00:36:04.228
No, I can feel it.


00:36:06.408 --> 00:36:08.468
Sir, I don't think he's here either.


00:36:10.178 --> 00:36:11.305
Where is he then?


00:36:12.514 --> 00:36:13.777
Who... knows?


00:36:16.451 --> 00:36:17.350
Get your gun out!


00:36:20.155 --> 00:36:20.986
Hey!


00:36:22.390 --> 00:36:23.323
Police! Freeze!


00:36:29.798 --> 00:36:31.824
What the hell?
No one's here.


00:36:32.500 --> 00:36:33.696
Dammit!


00:36:36.505 --> 00:36:38.599
Chief, take a look!


00:36:40.543 --> 00:36:42.569
So he did live here.


00:36:44.580 --> 00:36:46.378
Maybe he got tipped off.


00:36:48.284 --> 00:36:50.480
Let's look around
for any evidence.


00:36:51.387 --> 00:36:52.252
Okay.


00:36:53.823 --> 00:36:56.258
Where could this fucker be?


00:38:04.795 --> 00:38:05.888
What are you doing there?


00:38:12.269 --> 00:38:13.737
Central District officer Lee Jin-ho.


00:38:14.638 --> 00:38:15.520
What's up?


00:38:15.572 --> 00:38:17.336
I was checking up
on a car accident report.


00:38:20.811 --> 00:38:21.471
This must be it.


00:38:26.216 --> 00:38:27.184
Any injuries?


00:38:27.484 --> 00:38:28.918
The report says,


00:38:29.386 --> 00:38:31.378
hit-and-run victim was
carried off in the trunk.


00:38:33.958 --> 00:38:35.824
When? Today?


00:38:36.461 --> 00:38:37.429
No, a few days ago.


00:38:37.962 --> 00:38:39.260
On the night of 21st?


00:38:41.632 --> 00:38:42.615
Who was the tipper?


00:38:42.667 --> 00:38:45.330
It was from a pay phone,
hung up before we could get ID.


00:38:49.874 --> 00:38:50.967
Det. Ko!
Find anything?


00:38:51.509 --> 00:38:53.842
- Officer Lee!
- Salute!


00:38:53.978 --> 00:38:54.536
Hey man!


00:38:55.480 --> 00:38:57.915
Remember Lt. Park
who helped us on the IAD matter?


00:38:58.282 --> 00:38:59.682
- He's in Park's unit.
- Yeah?


00:38:59.884 --> 00:39:00.544
What are you doing?


00:39:00.952 --> 00:39:05.481
It's a hit-and-run,
the perp left with the body.


00:39:05.857 --> 00:39:06.605
Oh yeah?


00:39:06.657 --> 00:39:07.750
Brass balls on that one.


00:39:08.526 --> 00:39:09.425
Find anything?


00:39:10.862 --> 00:39:13.889
I have to check
the security cam feed.


00:39:17.735 --> 00:39:19.966
Good, we should take a look too.


00:39:20.638 --> 00:39:22.607
Maybe Lee makes a cameo.


00:39:23.341 --> 00:39:24.206
Sure.


00:39:24.542 --> 00:39:25.703
- Go follow up on it.
- Okay.


00:39:26.277 --> 00:39:29.338
Chief, I can do that,
I'll check it out.


00:39:29.814 --> 00:39:30.713
- Yeah?
- Sure.


00:39:31.816 --> 00:39:33.284
- Nah. Choi, you do it.
- Okay.


00:39:33.384 --> 00:39:34.444
No, allow me.


00:39:34.720 --> 00:39:37.019
Buy Park a round of
drinks afterwards.


00:39:37.923 --> 00:39:39.255
You don't know him anyway.


00:39:39.358 --> 00:39:41.259
I've been away too long,
I don't mind.


00:39:41.560 --> 00:39:42.027
I'll take care of it.


00:39:42.694 --> 00:39:44.287
I need to take some photos.


00:39:44.496 --> 00:39:45.828
- Yeah? I'll meet you later.
- Okay.


00:39:46.365 --> 00:39:47.196
See you soon.


00:39:50.736 --> 00:39:53.672
Is that so?


00:39:54.606 --> 00:39:55.801
A big fat raincheck then.


00:39:56.642 --> 00:39:57.337
Great.


00:39:58.410 --> 00:39:59.935
Today was perfect.


00:40:01.446 --> 00:40:02.778
What brings you here?


00:40:04.950 --> 00:40:05.599
Evening, sir.


00:40:05.651 --> 00:40:08.314
What's got into you?
I love you, man.


00:40:08.453 --> 00:40:09.216
Snack time.


00:40:10.556 --> 00:40:12.320
- Anything?
- Not a thing.


00:40:17.596 --> 00:40:20.896
How's the hit-and-run case?


00:40:21.934 --> 00:40:23.027
The video quality is bad,


00:40:23.635 --> 00:40:26.434
and this must be the spot,
but nothing yet.


00:40:26.838 --> 00:40:29.672
Bad quality, huh?


00:40:31.843 --> 00:40:32.742
- Officer Lee.
- Yes, sir?


00:40:32.978 --> 00:40:33.638
Let's eat.


00:40:33.879 --> 00:40:34.848
Come on, take a break.


00:40:36.549 --> 00:40:38.711
Wait, rewind a bit.


00:40:39.586 --> 00:40:40.349
Sir?


00:40:40.587 --> 00:40:41.850
The video, rewind it.


00:40:45.892 --> 00:40:46.552
Play.


00:40:50.563 --> 00:40:51.428
Right there.


00:40:55.034 --> 00:40:55.626
A frame forward.


00:40:56.669 --> 00:40:58.535
There! That's it!


00:41:01.140 --> 00:41:02.699
- Brake lights!
- What about it?


00:41:03.109 --> 00:41:06.705
Other cars just drove off,
but why'd this car brake here?


00:41:06.980 --> 00:41:09.711
Because something popped up,
so he braked!


00:41:10.016 --> 00:41:10.745
What happened next?


00:41:11.618 --> 00:41:12.449
Bang!


00:41:12.852 --> 00:41:13.785
Where's the accident point?


00:41:17.523 --> 00:41:18.957
- About here.
- See?


00:41:19.459 --> 00:41:20.586
Made impact here,


00:41:21.661 --> 00:41:23.129
and he fell on this spot.


00:41:23.529 --> 00:41:24.758
Look, that bitch.


00:41:25.398 --> 00:41:26.388
The mutt's watching something.


00:41:27.000 --> 00:41:29.128
Which means,
something happened here.


00:41:29.702 --> 00:41:32.433
This is the night of 21st.
The car type is...


00:41:34.741 --> 00:41:35.505
It's Lotze, definitely.


00:41:36.410 --> 00:41:37.275
A black one.


00:41:37.578 --> 00:41:38.307
Wait!


00:41:38.779 --> 00:41:39.712
- You got a Lotze, right?
- What?


00:41:40.080 --> 00:41:40.740
Is this a Lotze?


00:41:42.783 --> 00:41:43.648
Yeah...


00:41:43.951 --> 00:41:44.646
The plate is...


00:41:47.521 --> 00:41:48.716
That's an 8, first one.


00:41:49.690 --> 00:41:50.658
Gun-su, looks like an 8, right?


00:41:56.163 --> 00:41:58.894
- More like 3.
- It is indeed 8!


00:41:58.999 --> 00:42:00.592
Left side is kinda visible too.


00:42:00.701 --> 00:42:02.431
It's 8!


00:42:02.903 --> 00:42:04.235
Next one is...


00:42:17.117 --> 00:42:18.551
I can't tell.


00:42:19.119 --> 00:42:20.178
Can't see shit.


00:42:28.562 --> 00:42:30.121
Are we still going away
for the weekend?


00:42:31.532 --> 00:42:32.522
For Mina's birthday.


00:42:32.633 --> 00:42:34.067
We are,
I told you already.


00:42:35.102 --> 00:42:36.162
Gun-su.


00:42:36.738 --> 00:42:39.606
I wanna talk about something,
don't be mad, okay?


00:42:41.943 --> 00:42:46.904
Can't we kick out our shop tenant
and open a toast shop there?


00:42:47.816 --> 00:42:49.444
I'm told snack shops
do well there!


00:42:49.718 --> 00:42:51.209
I'll pay the full rent!


00:42:51.619 --> 00:42:53.554
We can't kick them out
before lease's up.


00:42:53.722 --> 00:42:54.690
But you're a cop.


00:42:54.956 --> 00:42:56.151
Cops aren't gangsters!


00:42:57.726 --> 00:43:00.093
Come on, let me.
Please?


00:43:01.229 --> 00:43:03.926
We can't live off you forever.


00:43:04.032 --> 00:43:04.727
Ow! Hot!


00:43:05.934 --> 00:43:06.697
Again?


00:43:07.869 --> 00:43:08.495
You okay?


00:43:08.937 --> 00:43:09.768
Yeah.


00:43:10.872 --> 00:43:13.467
I gotta do something about
that shower head.


00:43:13.742 --> 00:43:15.472
It's a great idea,
don't you think?


00:43:15.777 --> 00:43:16.745
Let's talk later, okay?


00:43:24.085 --> 00:43:25.644
- By the way.
- What now!


00:43:26.020 --> 00:43:28.512
Did mom have a man?


00:43:29.524 --> 00:43:30.719
What are you saying?


00:43:30.925 --> 00:43:33.121
I went to a fortuneteller yesterday,


00:43:33.995 --> 00:43:36.192
and he said mom had a man.


00:43:36.665 --> 00:43:37.997
By her side, even now.


00:43:40.169 --> 00:43:40.918
What?


00:43:40.970 --> 00:43:44.134
It's weird,
he got everything else right.


00:43:45.307 --> 00:43:49.745
About his failed flower shop,
even your divorce.


00:43:51.814 --> 00:43:53.510
Maybe mom did have a lover.


00:43:54.950 --> 00:43:56.976
What? She did?


00:43:57.553 --> 00:43:59.078
Yeah, I guess.


00:43:59.755 --> 00:44:01.155
Wow, that's awesome!


00:44:01.323 --> 00:44:02.552
Isn't it?


00:44:06.595 --> 00:44:08.791
NATIONAL LISTING OF
BLACK LOTZE OWNERS


00:44:10.966 --> 00:44:13.231
KO GUN-SU


00:44:21.310 --> 00:44:22.300
Western District homicide.


00:44:22.778 --> 00:44:25.646
Good afternoon,
I'd like to report a wanted man.


00:44:25.815 --> 00:44:26.783
One moment please.


00:44:29.185 --> 00:44:29.845
Go ahead.


00:44:30.619 --> 00:44:32.087
I saw Lee Gwang-min.


00:44:32.822 --> 00:44:34.256
What? Who?


00:44:35.658 --> 00:44:36.718
I saw Lee Gwang-min.


00:44:40.831 --> 00:44:42.595
Listen, mister.


00:44:44.267 --> 00:44:46.202
Don't make prank calls, okay?


00:44:53.677 --> 00:44:55.077
Western District homicide.


00:44:59.216 --> 00:45:00.616
I think it's the same dude.


00:45:00.851 --> 00:45:01.546
What is it?


00:45:01.685 --> 00:45:03.119
He's asking for you.


00:45:06.456 --> 00:45:09.790
What is it?
I said don't prank call!


00:45:09.893 --> 00:45:12.362
I wanted to make a report,
why is that a prank?


00:45:16.166 --> 00:45:16.861
Fine, let's hear it.


00:45:19.169 --> 00:45:20.603
Like I said,
I saw Lee Gwang-min.


00:45:21.705 --> 00:45:22.968
Where is he now then?


00:45:23.773 --> 00:45:25.366
That's what I wanted to ask you.


00:45:25.942 --> 00:45:27.877
Are you jerking me off?
What a guy.


00:45:27.978 --> 00:45:30.846
No, I mean, where did you
take him, Det. Ko?


00:45:31.047 --> 00:45:31.878
Say what?


00:45:32.749 --> 00:45:35.082
Did he fly into the sunset
or dug himself into the earth?


00:45:36.219 --> 00:45:37.813
Black Lotze's Ko Gun-su.


00:45:46.297 --> 00:45:49.028
UNKNOWN CALLER ID


00:45:59.243 --> 00:46:00.040
Western District...


00:46:01.879 --> 00:46:02.608
Yes.


00:46:04.215 --> 00:46:05.183
Det. Ko.


00:46:05.950 --> 00:46:06.365
Yeah?


00:46:06.417 --> 00:46:07.715
He wants you to
answer your phone.


00:46:09.687 --> 00:46:10.402
What?


00:46:10.454 --> 00:46:11.649
Your cell phone.


00:46:11.989 --> 00:46:16.393
UNKNOWN CALLER ID


00:46:24.302 --> 00:46:25.201
Who is this?


00:46:25.803 --> 00:46:28.796
The one who knows
you killed Lee.


00:46:37.182 --> 00:46:39.048
Sleeping fine after killing a man?


00:46:39.985 --> 00:46:42.955
I don't know what the hell
you're talking about.


00:46:43.755 --> 00:46:44.552
Who are you?


00:46:45.490 --> 00:46:48.392
Det. Ko, you're beginning to
look pathetic.


00:46:50.862 --> 00:46:56.358
I think you're gravely
mistaken about something.


00:46:57.269 --> 00:46:59.829
Wow, nice job fixing your car.


00:47:00.339 --> 00:47:00.965
You've been busy.


00:47:03.909 --> 00:47:05.002
Oh that...


00:47:06.745 --> 00:47:11.149
I had a minor collision
that my insurance took care of.


00:47:12.351 --> 00:47:15.913
You got it all wrong, right?


00:47:16.154 --> 00:47:19.420
- Already got an alibi?
- I'm hanging up now.


00:47:19.791 --> 00:47:22.317
Should I report that Lee was
spotted at Mt. Yangja?


00:47:23.261 --> 00:47:24.490
I hope you buried him well.


00:47:25.764 --> 00:47:27.756
That never happened,
so stop calling, motherfucker!


00:47:27.899 --> 00:47:30.835
I'll report when you hang up.


00:47:31.937 --> 00:47:35.465
See? You killed him.


00:47:35.841 --> 00:47:36.900
Son of a bitch!


00:47:38.444 --> 00:47:40.310
Tell me,
who are you?


00:47:41.114 --> 00:47:41.945
I've had it!


00:47:42.048 --> 00:47:45.348
Swear at me once more,
I'll report.


00:47:46.185 --> 00:47:47.319
Got your attention?


00:47:47.371 --> 00:47:48.453
- Salute!
- Salute!


00:47:51.057 --> 00:47:52.923
You're not in the right
mindset to listen.


00:47:54.127 --> 00:47:57.063
I'll let you sweat a bit
and tell you my demands.


00:47:59.198 --> 00:48:02.794
And don't bother looking for me,
I'll report if you annoy me.


00:48:04.437 --> 00:48:05.996
You look better than I expected.


00:48:07.106 --> 00:48:08.096
Must not feel guilt.


00:48:09.242 --> 00:48:09.937
Great attitude.


00:49:52.147 --> 00:49:55.083
What the hell!


00:50:10.165 --> 00:50:11.394
The light's green,
why aren't you going?!


00:50:14.235 --> 00:50:15.498
Shall we... go?


00:50:16.638 --> 00:50:17.128
Mister.


00:50:19.240 --> 00:50:21.505
I said $10 per second.


00:50:23.378 --> 00:50:25.142
You already made...


00:50:25.647 --> 00:50:28.913
$150, $160,
wow, $200.


00:50:40.329 --> 00:50:42.696
UNKNOWN CALLER ID:
HAVING CAR TROUBLES?


00:50:44.233 --> 00:50:45.132
Goddammit!


00:50:45.334 --> 00:50:46.165
Get ready.


00:51:22.438 --> 00:51:22.962
Fuck...


00:52:18.628 --> 00:52:20.460
POLICE STATION


00:52:51.395 --> 00:52:52.624
- What's wrong?
- Huh?


00:52:53.731 --> 00:52:54.255
Had a nightmare?


00:52:55.433 --> 00:52:56.628
Were you napping?


00:52:56.801 --> 00:52:58.463
We've been hiking all day.


00:52:59.837 --> 00:53:00.497
Where were you?


00:53:00.805 --> 00:53:01.568
Mt. Yangja.


00:53:02.373 --> 00:53:04.433
Isn't your mother buried there?


00:53:05.409 --> 00:53:06.172
Yeah.


00:53:07.712 --> 00:53:08.645
Wait.


00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:11.180
Why there?


00:53:11.649 --> 00:53:14.278
Lee's cell phone's last
known location was there,


00:53:14.552 --> 00:53:17.647
but due to network overlap,
we didn't get a pinpoint location.


00:53:18.189 --> 00:53:20.181
The car looks new,
did you replace the bumper?


00:53:21.292 --> 00:53:21.759
Had an accident?


00:53:22.426 --> 00:53:24.725
Yeah, I told you about that.


00:53:25.563 --> 00:53:26.531
Right.


00:53:26.864 --> 00:53:27.695
Replaced the whole front?


00:53:28.366 --> 00:53:29.334
Good thing you weren't hurt.


00:53:31.135 --> 00:53:32.626
Your phone, you got a call.


00:53:40.912 --> 00:53:42.380
UNKNOWN CALLER ID


00:53:54.626 --> 00:53:57.460
How can a cop be so bad
at a chase?


00:54:00.165 --> 00:54:02.862
Did you give it a thought?
Can we talk now?


00:54:03.468 --> 00:54:05.801
- I have a question.
- Okay.


00:54:06.438 --> 00:54:08.600
How did you see me...


00:54:11.810 --> 00:54:14.905
burying Lee?
It was pitch dark.


00:54:15.914 --> 00:54:17.883
Dark? Doesn't mean I can't.


00:54:18.283 --> 00:54:19.808
Let's not get sidetracked.


00:54:19.918 --> 00:54:20.886
You didn't see it yourself.


00:54:22.387 --> 00:54:23.514
You don't know where Lee is.


00:54:28.927 --> 00:54:29.451
Then...


00:54:31.563 --> 00:54:35.466
whether you report,
or start digging,


00:54:36.435 --> 00:54:37.630
go right ahead.


00:54:38.370 --> 00:54:40.840
But you'll never find him.


00:54:41.941 --> 00:54:42.738
Why?


00:54:43.476 --> 00:54:45.707
There's no proof that
he was buried, asshole!


00:54:46.412 --> 00:54:48.540
There's no proof,
you fucking asshole!


00:54:49.715 --> 00:54:50.705
I'm done, fucker!


00:54:55.588 --> 00:54:56.180
Goddammit...


00:54:57.423 --> 00:54:58.652
Gun-su, be cool!


00:55:00.593 --> 00:55:01.356
Be cool.


00:55:17.977 --> 00:55:19.206
Answer the damn phone.


00:55:20.880 --> 00:55:22.508
- Dinner anyone?
- Western District...


00:55:23.316 --> 00:55:24.545
- Sure, I'm friggin' starving.
- One moment...


00:55:25.551 --> 00:55:26.814
He wants to report a car accident.


00:55:26.919 --> 00:55:28.251
- Then transfer to traffic.
- Hey, hey, hey!


00:55:33.326 --> 00:55:34.817
- It's a prank call.
- Yeah?


00:55:45.973 --> 00:55:46.838
What is it?


00:55:48.275 --> 00:55:50.437
We've been getting
prank calls all afternoon.


00:55:51.845 --> 00:55:55.373
Prank calling should be fined,
that'll teach them.


00:55:55.616 --> 00:55:56.515
Go eat, go on.


00:55:56.717 --> 00:55:57.582
Sure.


00:56:00.621 --> 00:56:03.648
They'll bitch at us
for not answering later.


00:56:03.891 --> 00:56:05.587
What a headache.


00:56:40.594 --> 00:56:42.291
Hey, hey!


00:56:42.397 --> 00:56:44.389
Stop it!
What's wrong?!


00:56:44.966 --> 00:56:45.695
What's going on?!


00:56:46.401 --> 00:56:49.496
How dare you ignore my calls!
Shall I expose you?!


00:56:49.771 --> 00:56:50.431
What's wrong?!


00:56:53.575 --> 00:56:54.508
What's with you?


00:56:56.778 --> 00:56:57.837
Shit, it's not him?


00:56:59.614 --> 00:57:00.429
No, no, no.


00:57:00.481 --> 00:57:01.972
What, wrong man?


00:57:03.084 --> 00:57:04.017
He's our colleague.


00:57:05.853 --> 00:57:07.583
- A cop?
- Yeah, a cop.


00:57:09.624 --> 00:57:11.354
Fuck, I've gone mental.


00:57:11.459 --> 00:57:13.325
Sorry, I'm so sorry.


00:57:13.528 --> 00:57:15.087
You looked like
the man who conned me.


00:57:15.997 --> 00:57:17.329
I'm sorry, truly.


00:57:18.099 --> 00:57:21.866
Chief, this is Lt. Park,
who helped us on the IAD matter.


00:57:22.971 --> 00:57:26.908
Lieutenant, so good to meet you,
we owe you.


00:57:27.875 --> 00:57:30.037
This is our savior!


00:57:30.645 --> 00:57:32.045
Gun-su, you got a beat
from our savior.


00:57:33.514 --> 00:57:35.449
- Det. Ko Gun-su?
- Yeah.


00:57:35.550 --> 00:57:36.483
Seriously?


00:57:36.751 --> 00:57:37.684
I don't believe this.


00:57:39.554 --> 00:57:40.715
I hope you're not bleeding.


00:57:42.591 --> 00:57:44.492
I'm sorry again,
let me formally introduce myself.


00:57:45.794 --> 00:57:46.454
I'm Park Chang-min.


00:57:47.997 --> 00:57:49.795
Something about you two.


00:57:49.999 --> 00:57:52.935
Saved you last time,
almost killed you today.


00:57:54.770 --> 00:57:55.999
You got a great face.


00:57:57.439 --> 00:57:59.670
Hold on,
let's see here...


00:58:03.112 --> 00:58:04.011
I'm sorry.


00:58:04.680 --> 00:58:05.443
Gonna visit the toilet.


00:58:13.489 --> 00:58:14.388
Almost had a heart attack.


00:58:16.125 --> 00:58:16.922
That's Lt. Park?


00:58:17.860 --> 00:58:18.828
Yeah.


00:58:40.449 --> 00:58:40.973
You startled me.


00:58:46.589 --> 00:58:49.957
There are 2 types of humans.


00:58:51.594 --> 00:58:53.893
One who lowers his tail
before the alpha.


00:58:54.931 --> 00:58:59.164
And the one who tries hard
after a beat.


00:58:59.602 --> 00:59:01.036
Which one are you?


00:59:09.646 --> 00:59:10.511
You're a cop?


00:59:11.681 --> 00:59:13.741
Didn't I give you a jolt?
That sinking feeling.


00:59:16.686 --> 00:59:17.210
What do you want?


00:59:18.788 --> 00:59:23.988
That was the most important
and smart thing you've ever said.


00:59:25.695 --> 00:59:27.789
What I want?
It's simple.


00:59:29.999 --> 00:59:31.934
Bring Lee.
No questions.


00:59:33.236 --> 00:59:34.226
Why?


00:59:37.107 --> 00:59:39.076
Curiosity killed the cat.


00:59:42.245 --> 00:59:44.647
Let's not mince words,
just get him.


00:59:47.952 --> 00:59:48.851
That's too bad though.


00:59:50.654 --> 00:59:54.250
I really don't know where he is.


01:00:04.101 --> 01:00:04.727
Not good.


01:00:23.821 --> 01:00:25.551
Motherfucker!


01:00:27.625 --> 01:00:29.253
Wait, wait, wait.


01:00:30.027 --> 01:00:31.655
You pack a punch.


01:00:35.099 --> 01:00:36.863
A cop shouldn't hit another cop.


01:00:37.334 --> 01:00:39.098
You got a mean hook.


01:00:41.839 --> 01:00:43.706
If your hook hurts this much,


01:00:44.810 --> 01:00:46.836
imagine Lee's pain
when you ran him over.


01:00:47.846 --> 01:00:48.643
Dammit!


01:00:52.751 --> 01:00:53.218
Come out!


01:00:56.855 --> 01:00:58.118
Come out, asshole!


01:01:09.968 --> 01:01:13.928
Connecting a few jabs
got your ego through the roof?


01:01:19.744 --> 01:01:21.610
You okay?
Still breathing.


01:01:26.651 --> 01:01:28.882
This is too gay for my taste.


01:01:29.888 --> 01:01:30.856
Hold still.


01:01:38.296 --> 01:01:40.629
Take it easy,
drink up.


01:01:45.705 --> 01:01:46.729
I'll get him!


01:01:46.939 --> 01:01:49.602
I'll get him!
I will!


01:01:53.412 --> 01:01:56.678
Now we're seeing eye to eye.


01:02:01.287 --> 01:02:01.879
Dang it.


01:02:12.665 --> 01:02:15.260
Get Lee ready by tonight.


01:02:21.374 --> 01:02:22.137
I'll call.


01:03:10.824 --> 01:03:11.587
Fuck...


01:03:13.226 --> 01:03:14.785
There has to be a reason.


01:03:16.363 --> 01:03:18.992
Why is he looking for a dead man?


01:03:23.737 --> 01:03:24.705
Give me a break!


01:03:33.947 --> 01:03:34.710
What's this?


01:03:46.894 --> 01:03:47.759
Bullet holes...


01:03:51.499 --> 01:03:52.467
He was already dead?


01:04:37.078 --> 01:04:38.011
Who's there?


01:05:02.438 --> 01:05:03.872
That bitch...


01:05:19.888 --> 01:05:21.322
PRIVATE PIGGY BANK


01:05:31.934 --> 01:05:34.199
Yo, Gwang-min!
Why's it so hard to reach you?!


01:05:34.536 --> 01:05:37.131
I thought Lt. Park
got to you already.


01:05:37.973 --> 01:05:39.032
Where are you?


01:05:39.475 --> 01:05:40.135
Why aren't you answ...


01:05:42.244 --> 01:05:44.270
You're not him...
Who are you?


01:05:51.421 --> 01:05:54.414
38-years old,
Jo Neung-hyun.


01:05:55.225 --> 01:05:57.626
3 prior convictions,


01:05:58.628 --> 01:06:01.427
from the same town as Lee,
probably worked together.


01:06:01.898 --> 01:06:03.560
Triangulate him
at 1-minute interval,


01:06:04.467 --> 01:06:09.371
and send his mugshot
and current location to my phone!


01:06:09.639 --> 01:06:11.972
Sir, that's illegal.


01:06:12.542 --> 01:06:14.101
I need to get a warrant and...


01:06:14.210 --> 01:06:16.645
Warrant my ass!
Time's ticking!


01:06:17.247 --> 01:06:18.340
Just send it,
I'll take the heat!


01:06:20.216 --> 01:06:21.479
- Det. Ko?
- Yes, sir.


01:06:21.584 --> 01:06:22.574
Where is he?


01:06:23.920 --> 01:06:24.910
I'm not sure.


01:06:25.355 --> 01:06:28.223
Where is that son of a bitch
roaming around?


01:06:29.492 --> 01:06:30.084
What's this?


01:06:30.960 --> 01:06:33.054
Those are our unit's traffic tickets.


01:06:33.229 --> 01:06:35.255
I wanted to take care of it
before we're fined.


01:06:35.698 --> 01:06:37.326
- Mine?
- No...


01:06:37.433 --> 01:06:38.401
Gun-su's, eh?


01:06:40.937 --> 01:06:41.563
$120.


01:06:42.172 --> 01:06:43.538
Like a bat out of hell.


01:06:58.556 --> 01:06:59.990
JO NEUNG-HYUN


01:07:31.422 --> 01:07:32.822
Motherfucker!


01:07:37.595 --> 01:07:38.756
Stop!


01:07:47.606 --> 01:07:50.041
Asshole, I'm not here for you!


01:07:50.609 --> 01:07:52.407
Let's just chat!


01:07:54.079 --> 01:07:55.047
Stop right there!


01:08:01.186 --> 01:08:01.983
Hey!


01:08:03.388 --> 01:08:04.321
Buddy, you okay?!


01:08:07.592 --> 01:08:08.389
Watch out for the cars!


01:08:09.327 --> 01:08:10.090
Is he nuts?!


01:08:10.729 --> 01:08:11.788
Stop!


01:08:14.366 --> 01:08:15.698
Fucking...


01:08:16.801 --> 01:08:20.761
What a fucking moron...


01:08:21.773 --> 01:08:23.765
I just want to talk...


01:08:24.743 --> 01:08:27.474
I really don't know!


01:08:27.579 --> 01:08:29.207
All I want to know is...


01:08:30.215 --> 01:08:33.583
the reason why
Park's looking for Lee.


01:08:33.685 --> 01:08:35.586
I don't know, I swear!


01:08:36.221 --> 01:08:38.520
Please let me go, okay?


01:08:40.525 --> 01:08:42.289
You really don't?


01:08:42.494 --> 01:08:43.757
I don't! Fuck you!


01:08:48.701 --> 01:08:50.101
Fine, just go.


01:08:50.503 --> 01:08:51.266
Thank you.


01:08:52.638 --> 01:08:53.537
Go.


01:08:54.373 --> 01:08:55.397
Step forward.


01:08:55.675 --> 01:08:58.270
- Go on.
- Wait!


01:08:58.544 --> 01:09:00.103
- Keep going.
- I can't!


01:09:00.379 --> 01:09:01.403
To your next life.


01:09:02.815 --> 01:09:03.510
Forward.


01:09:04.417 --> 01:09:05.817
- Go ahead.
- Don't untie it!


01:09:05.918 --> 01:09:07.682
Don't untie, you assho...
Please!


01:09:07.787 --> 01:09:09.415
Step forward,
I'm letting you go!


01:09:09.522 --> 01:09:10.512
I'll talk! I'll tell you!


01:09:11.257 --> 01:09:12.418
I'll fucking talk!


01:09:12.725 --> 01:09:15.752
Don't swear motherfucker!
Don't fucking swear!


01:09:16.395 --> 01:09:17.090
I'll tell you.


01:09:20.833 --> 01:09:25.396
Lee stole Park's key.


01:09:27.306 --> 01:09:28.205
Key?


01:09:28.507 --> 01:09:30.476
To a private safe.
Park's key.


01:09:31.243 --> 01:09:32.233
What's inside?


01:09:34.380 --> 01:09:35.313
Talk, asshole!


01:09:35.414 --> 01:09:38.612
Fuck! I'm so fucking scared!
Son of a bitch!


01:09:39.385 --> 01:09:42.685
From the beginning,
speak concisely!


01:09:43.155 --> 01:09:43.570
I'll talk.


01:09:43.622 --> 01:09:46.457
- Don't make me ask you again.
- Okay, I'll talk.


01:09:47.427 --> 01:09:50.488
The drugs that Park brought in...


01:09:52.299 --> 01:09:53.733
- Drugs?
- Yes.


01:09:56.303 --> 01:09:59.569
When Park was in vice squad,


01:10:00.741 --> 01:10:03.802
he snatched the confiscated drugs.


01:10:37.377 --> 01:10:40.711
I hear tons of drugs get
confiscated by the customs,


01:10:41.782 --> 01:10:45.685
he sold some off,
and ran bars and clubs with it.


01:10:46.820 --> 01:10:48.312
It was a mega hit.


01:10:49.257 --> 01:10:50.782
Once you taste it,
you can never go back.


01:10:51.893 --> 01:10:53.521
You'll become
a permanent regular.


01:10:54.929 --> 01:10:57.626
Even the Yakuza wanted
a piece of it.


01:10:59.200 --> 01:11:02.261
Park was a major player
in this scene.


01:11:22.423 --> 01:11:26.485
When Park went to sign a deal
with Yakuza, Lee took off.


01:11:27.528 --> 01:11:28.826
With the money and drugs.


01:11:31.332 --> 01:11:33.267
So where's the key now?


01:11:34.635 --> 01:11:36.661
Lee keeps anything important
on his body.


01:11:37.638 --> 01:11:38.606
Inside.


01:11:53.822 --> 01:11:55.484
What the hell am I doing?


01:11:57.993 --> 01:11:58.983
So nasty!


01:12:00.496 --> 01:12:01.589
Fuck!


01:12:22.918 --> 01:12:24.819
Ko Gun-su!
Stay there!


01:12:25.621 --> 01:12:26.850
Don't move.


01:12:29.291 --> 01:12:30.452
What the fuck man?!


01:12:31.460 --> 01:12:32.325
Drop the knife!


01:12:33.529 --> 01:12:34.292
- Listen...
- Drop the knife!


01:12:34.496 --> 01:12:35.312
Come on, man.


01:12:35.364 --> 01:12:36.354
Drop the fucking knife!


01:12:36.465 --> 01:12:38.457
Just relax.


01:12:42.704 --> 01:12:44.039
Back off.


01:12:44.091 --> 01:12:45.322
Hey, hey!


01:12:45.374 --> 01:12:45.932
I... I didn't do this.


01:12:46.375 --> 01:12:47.570
Then why are you here!


01:12:47.677 --> 01:12:48.940
I didn't! I didn't kill him!


01:12:49.379 --> 01:12:50.039
What happened is...


01:12:50.547 --> 01:12:52.641
You have to believe me!


01:12:53.082 --> 01:12:54.573
Here, take a look.


01:12:55.418 --> 01:12:57.478
You had the accident on 23rd.


01:12:57.887 --> 01:12:59.378
This is from 2 days earlier.


01:13:00.356 --> 01:13:03.019
Your car was already wrecked
before the accident.


01:13:03.660 --> 01:13:05.458
Am I still wrong?
Am I?!


01:13:06.429 --> 01:13:07.988
Alright, just lower your gun.


01:13:08.865 --> 01:13:12.302
Hey! What are you doing?!


01:13:12.402 --> 01:13:15.998
We're no model cops,
but you've gone too far!


01:13:16.439 --> 01:13:18.965
Come on!
You got it all wrong!


01:13:19.976 --> 01:13:21.000
Goddammit!


01:13:38.361 --> 01:13:39.590
How did you end up like this?


01:13:39.862 --> 01:13:40.989
Forget it,
just drop it.


01:13:42.632 --> 01:13:46.763
I'll confess back at the station,
so let's go.


01:13:49.873 --> 01:13:51.501
I'm really tired today.


01:13:53.043 --> 01:13:56.810
Whatever happens,
I just wanna rest.


01:13:58.115 --> 01:13:58.741
Rest?


01:14:00.884 --> 01:14:01.476
You wanna rest?


01:14:02.853 --> 01:14:05.755
Always so nonchalant.


01:14:06.724 --> 01:14:11.662
Manslaughter and disposal of body
will get you near life.


01:14:11.929 --> 01:14:13.955
Who cares about you,
but your kid?


01:14:15.165 --> 01:14:17.031
You drive me insane.


01:14:18.602 --> 01:14:19.695
Absolutely insane.


01:14:26.810 --> 01:14:29.405
Fuck it, I don't care.


01:14:30.814 --> 01:14:32.146
Do whatever, it's up to you.


01:14:36.120 --> 01:14:37.144
Take it.


01:14:38.656 --> 01:14:39.487
Fuck it all.


01:14:44.662 --> 01:14:46.096
Would I live comfortably
with you locked up?


01:14:47.197 --> 01:14:49.531
You got an interesting fate.


01:14:50.001 --> 01:14:52.994
Your mother's funeral is barely over,
and now this?


01:14:53.738 --> 01:14:54.535
Sang-ho.


01:14:54.839 --> 01:14:56.432
Don't thank me,
I don't wanna hear it.


01:14:56.775 --> 01:14:58.141
- Help me.
- What now?!


01:15:00.712 --> 01:15:02.476
I'm being blackmailed by a cop.


01:15:04.449 --> 01:15:05.576
What's this nonsense?


01:15:06.117 --> 01:15:06.914
You know him.


01:15:08.119 --> 01:15:09.052
Park Chang-min.


01:15:09.788 --> 01:15:13.418
I think he killed Lee too.


01:15:14.626 --> 01:15:19.462
That corpse up there,
that's Lee.


01:15:23.868 --> 01:15:27.168
You have to believe
everything I tell you, okay?


01:15:29.941 --> 01:15:30.772
That night...


01:15:32.510 --> 01:15:34.979
I did hit someone.


01:15:36.948 --> 01:15:37.745
Hold on.


01:15:39.017 --> 01:15:40.451
UNKNOWN CALLER ID


01:15:48.894 --> 01:15:49.677
Hello?


01:15:49.729 --> 01:15:51.095
It's me,
is Det. Choi with you?


01:15:52.631 --> 01:15:53.291
What?


01:15:53.666 --> 01:15:55.532
Get out,
this is important.


01:15:57.703 --> 01:15:59.069
Are you watching us now?


01:16:00.606 --> 01:16:03.633
If you don't want to be
a burden on him, get out.


01:16:08.748 --> 01:16:09.807
What is it?!


01:16:11.283 --> 01:16:13.548
You like being a peeping tom?


01:16:16.021 --> 01:16:19.856
Shut up and come to the street
in front of you.


01:16:20.826 --> 01:16:21.850
5 more steps forward.


01:16:24.897 --> 01:16:27.196
- There?
- Yes, where are you?


01:16:28.033 --> 01:16:28.966
Okay.


01:16:30.302 --> 01:16:31.770
Hello? Hello!


01:16:32.638 --> 01:16:33.401
Hey!


01:16:36.041 --> 01:16:36.906
Son of a bitch...


01:17:10.944 --> 01:17:12.310
UNKNOWN CALLER ID


01:17:20.620 --> 01:17:23.920
How was the aim?
The driver's good eh?


01:17:24.858 --> 01:17:26.156
Chatting up is all but over.


01:17:27.727 --> 01:17:29.628
Dig up Lee by 6 a. m.


01:17:32.365 --> 01:17:33.162
What have you done?


01:17:36.703 --> 01:17:38.797
I told you I'd bring him, fucker!


01:17:39.606 --> 01:17:40.232
Are you crying?


01:17:41.708 --> 01:17:45.145
Didn't know you were emotional,
focus on the work.


01:17:45.612 --> 01:17:46.341
Buddy.


01:17:50.651 --> 01:17:51.200
It's off.


01:17:51.252 --> 01:17:55.019
I'm turning myself in.
You're finished too, motherfucker!


01:17:57.058 --> 01:17:59.027
You're finished!


01:17:59.660 --> 01:18:01.754
Yeah?
Hold on a minute.


01:18:03.664 --> 01:18:04.180
Who is it?


01:18:04.232 --> 01:18:06.724
It's Lt. Park,
I called earlier.


01:18:07.802 --> 01:18:08.394
Oh, hello.


01:18:09.036 --> 01:18:09.867
Good to see you.


01:18:10.738 --> 01:18:13.173
- Gun-su's not here yet.
- It's him on the phone.


01:18:13.708 --> 01:18:15.768
- I'm at your house now.
- Don't you dare!


01:18:17.211 --> 01:18:17.940
Wait inside?


01:18:19.347 --> 01:18:20.815
I see, hurry now.


01:18:21.716 --> 01:18:23.742
Hi, you must be Mina!


01:18:24.085 --> 01:18:26.213
Don't! Please don't!


01:18:45.039 --> 01:18:45.802
Welcome home.


01:18:46.440 --> 01:18:46.930
Hey.


01:18:49.176 --> 01:18:49.836
Mina's sleeping.


01:18:59.288 --> 01:18:59.778
Hey!


01:19:03.025 --> 01:19:04.015
What's wrong with you?


01:19:04.793 --> 01:19:05.624
Wasn't...


01:19:08.297 --> 01:19:10.391
Wasn't someone here?


01:19:11.033 --> 01:19:11.830
Your friend...


01:19:12.301 --> 01:19:14.998
He dropped off a toy,
he said he'd be back.


01:19:15.470 --> 01:19:16.301
What?


01:19:42.731 --> 01:19:47.135
TURNING YOURSELF IN WON'T
END YOUR PROBLEM.


01:19:48.337 --> 01:19:50.363
BRING LEE BY 6.


01:20:01.117 --> 01:20:02.085
Fucking hell...


01:20:18.001 --> 01:20:20.334
I made hotel reservations,


01:20:21.070 --> 01:20:24.131
so when Mina wakes up,
you guys go on ahead.


01:20:24.807 --> 01:20:25.467
Got it?


01:20:26.042 --> 01:20:26.873
You're not coming with?


01:20:27.343 --> 01:20:29.903
I'll come as soon as
I finish work.


01:20:30.079 --> 01:20:30.978
When will that be?


01:20:31.814 --> 01:20:33.248
I'll be there ASAP,
so get there first!


01:20:35.251 --> 01:20:37.049
- Are you in trouble?
- Of course not.


01:20:37.820 --> 01:20:40.483
Here, this is the reservation slip.


01:20:41.290 --> 01:20:42.349
Okay? I gotta go.


01:20:43.092 --> 01:20:46.256
5 blanks returned,
and here's 5 live rounds.


01:20:46.362 --> 01:20:47.057
Okay.


01:20:47.330 --> 01:20:51.393
Detective, could you
sign the release form?


01:20:53.237 --> 01:20:53.863
It's not here...


01:20:54.538 --> 01:20:55.335
One moment.


01:20:57.274 --> 01:20:59.402
Detective, we ordered some food,


01:21:00.344 --> 01:21:01.778
would you like to join us?


01:21:02.212 --> 01:21:05.444
Their sauce's a little different.


01:21:05.916 --> 01:21:06.940
It's so good.


01:21:26.003 --> 01:21:28.063
I'll give him back alright!


01:21:59.170 --> 01:22:01.298
Slow down now.


01:22:03.475 --> 01:22:05.205
That's far enough.


01:22:08.346 --> 01:22:08.972
Bring the body over.


01:22:41.546 --> 01:22:42.570
Load him.


01:22:49.254 --> 01:22:50.586
Hold it, stay put.


01:22:51.122 --> 01:22:52.386
Look what we got here?


01:22:54.994 --> 01:22:57.429
Hold still asshole!
Car key...


01:22:58.531 --> 01:23:00.090
Got anything else?


01:23:04.270 --> 01:23:05.602
Well, look at this.


01:23:13.646 --> 01:23:15.114
Move aside.


01:23:40.472 --> 01:23:41.235
Still inside.


01:23:44.743 --> 01:23:47.474
Those bullet holes,
did you shoot him?


01:23:48.647 --> 01:23:51.048
Yeah, about that.


01:23:52.051 --> 01:23:52.951
Okay, I shot him,


01:23:54.221 --> 01:23:55.985
then bam!
You ran him over.


01:23:57.591 --> 01:23:58.388
So who killed him?


01:24:00.327 --> 01:24:01.260
You? Or me?


01:24:03.096 --> 01:24:04.086
Okay, well...


01:24:04.364 --> 01:24:05.297
That's not very important.


01:24:07.734 --> 01:24:08.531
Are we done here?


01:24:09.536 --> 01:24:10.367
Need a receipt or something?


01:24:11.538 --> 01:24:12.471
I'm going.


01:24:17.377 --> 01:24:19.642
Wait, one last thing.


01:24:23.250 --> 01:24:25.185
It's a blank.


01:24:26.453 --> 01:24:28.046
Hey, hey! Wait!


01:24:30.423 --> 01:24:31.356
Look!


01:24:32.759 --> 01:24:35.422
I've been a fucking cop
for a decade!


01:24:36.263 --> 01:24:38.289
Would I come here
without an insurance?!


01:24:39.199 --> 01:24:41.100
If you fucking kill me,


01:24:42.702 --> 01:24:49.131
then a timed e-mail will be sent
to the station in the morning.


01:24:50.310 --> 01:24:54.646
It contains details
of your drug dealings,


01:24:55.549 --> 01:24:57.381
illegal brothel operation!


01:24:57.585 --> 01:25:01.386
As well as the murders of
Lee and Det. Choi!


01:25:01.822 --> 01:25:03.791
I'm sure those are
just a few of your crimes,


01:25:04.792 --> 01:25:08.320
but I bet $180 that you'll
at least get a life sentence!


01:25:08.562 --> 01:25:10.121
I think you missed a few others.


01:25:11.132 --> 01:25:12.657
Go ahead, shoot me!


01:25:15.269 --> 01:25:18.433
Are you gonna shoot?
Get it over with.


01:25:19.240 --> 01:25:21.106
If you won't,
then holster it, fucker!


01:25:22.476 --> 01:25:23.136
Time's ticking.


01:25:29.350 --> 01:25:30.283
Okay.


01:25:32.620 --> 01:25:35.089
Why would I kill you?


01:25:35.189 --> 01:25:37.784
You're a useful guy,
why'd I do that?


01:25:38.526 --> 01:25:41.155
We're on the same boat, right?


01:25:42.463 --> 01:25:43.158
Let's work together.


01:25:45.132 --> 01:25:49.263
It's about time
you play with the big boys.


01:25:49.870 --> 01:25:51.805
You gotta live hard.
And raise Mina properly.


01:25:53.475 --> 01:25:56.240
Damn, that was awesome.


01:25:57.412 --> 01:25:59.404
Take care, man.


01:26:16.565 --> 01:26:18.557
Why is that fucker
coming this way?!


01:26:30.679 --> 01:26:32.341
No, no, no!


01:26:33.815 --> 01:26:36.182
Just keep going!


01:26:44.826 --> 01:26:45.350
Det. Ko.


01:26:46.728 --> 01:26:51.632
There's an amazing diner
no one knows near here.


01:26:51.733 --> 01:26:54.329
I'll let you in on the secret.


01:26:54.570 --> 01:26:56.471
- The soup there...
- I don't want it!


01:27:01.511 --> 01:27:02.570
Your loss.


01:30:25.384 --> 01:30:28.047
Yeah, I'm on my way.
What's Mina doing?


01:30:28.721 --> 01:30:29.347
Hold on.


01:30:29.722 --> 01:30:31.850
Mina, it's daddy.


01:30:34.126 --> 01:30:36.721
Sweetie, it's dad.


01:30:36.829 --> 01:30:38.889
Did you eat
your birthday breakfast?


01:30:39.431 --> 01:30:40.626
Yes, I ate so much.


01:30:41.567 --> 01:30:46.062
While I'm not there,
be good to aunt and uncle.


01:30:46.171 --> 01:30:48.538
Have all your meals, okay?


01:30:49.074 --> 01:30:51.066
Okay. Get here fast, daddy.


01:30:52.044 --> 01:30:52.875
Sure, sweetie.


01:30:54.546 --> 01:30:55.640
Wait a little longer.


01:30:57.117 --> 01:30:58.415
Daddy, bye!


01:30:59.486 --> 01:31:00.351
Yeah, bye bye.


01:31:00.820 --> 01:31:02.118
I love you, daddy!


01:31:03.657 --> 01:31:06.092
- When's dad coming?
- Very soon.


01:31:06.259 --> 01:31:08.455
- Oh yeah?
- Hey Mina...


01:31:20.540 --> 01:31:22.065
CHIEF


01:31:38.992 --> 01:31:39.982
Good, you were home.


01:31:43.129 --> 01:31:43.653
Thank you.


01:32:15.896 --> 01:32:16.556
Surprised?


01:32:21.202 --> 01:32:22.135
I was too.


01:32:27.708 --> 01:32:28.539
Come in.


01:32:31.645 --> 01:32:32.408
Come in.


01:33:00.876 --> 01:33:01.809
CHIEF


01:33:07.149 --> 01:33:08.583
MISSED CALL: CHIEF


01:33:13.822 --> 01:33:14.846
Son of a bitch!


01:33:36.011 --> 01:33:36.774
Dead?


01:33:43.785 --> 01:33:45.754
Holy shit...


01:34:14.217 --> 01:34:15.845
Thanks to you asshole,


01:34:17.720 --> 01:34:19.211
I broke the diving record.


01:34:57.094 --> 01:34:58.289
What are you doing?


01:34:59.263 --> 01:35:00.253
Come on out!


01:35:03.967 --> 01:35:06.163
Wanna go again?!


01:35:09.506 --> 01:35:11.941
Open this door, shithead!


01:35:13.710 --> 01:35:14.575
Let's see...


01:35:36.133 --> 01:35:37.157
Goddammit!


01:36:00.425 --> 01:36:02.018
What the fuck are you doing?!


01:36:10.501 --> 01:36:13.164
You're fucking dead!


01:36:26.184 --> 01:36:26.913
Dammit!


01:37:05.224 --> 01:37:07.284
Did you fly?


01:37:29.248 --> 01:37:30.045
Come here, you fuck!


01:37:34.453 --> 01:37:35.216
You're fucking dead!


01:37:49.835 --> 01:37:50.564
You fuck!


01:38:09.122 --> 01:38:10.818
You fuck!


01:39:16.223 --> 01:39:17.122
Fuck off!


01:40:51.219 --> 01:40:58.251
Theft and distribution of narcotics,
operating a brothel,


01:40:58.693 --> 01:41:03.359
homicide of an officer,
hit-and-run, theft of evidence...


01:41:04.734 --> 01:41:06.532
This will bury us all.


01:41:08.271 --> 01:41:10.001
Let's cover it up.


01:41:10.339 --> 01:41:11.102
Sir?


01:41:11.741 --> 01:41:13.471
What should we do with him?


01:41:18.147 --> 01:41:22.448
Why so soon after
a new commissioner took office?


01:41:24.186 --> 01:41:25.051
Chief Jang, right?


01:41:26.088 --> 01:41:26.714
Yes, sir.


01:41:28.124 --> 01:41:30.025
Can you take this to your grave?


01:41:31.093 --> 01:41:31.651
For his sake.


01:41:35.398 --> 01:41:37.230
Yes, I'll take it to my grave.


01:41:39.368 --> 01:41:40.267
Good.


01:41:51.147 --> 01:41:53.810
I understand how you feel,
but life isn't all about that.


01:41:55.284 --> 01:41:59.346
A year flies by when you're
relaxing in the country.


01:42:01.725 --> 01:42:04.422
Giving your severance to
Choi's mother is fine.


01:42:05.262 --> 01:42:08.824
But what can you do
besides being a cop?


01:42:10.500 --> 01:42:12.765
There're over 12,000 jobs
in this country.


01:42:14.338 --> 01:42:15.306
I'll find something.


01:42:18.208 --> 01:42:20.609
With you gone,
I got nobody!


01:42:22.746 --> 01:42:23.907
Gun-su...


01:42:24.214 --> 01:42:26.183
Remember when you became a cop?


01:42:26.717 --> 01:42:28.310
You had 1 adamant goal.


01:42:30.854 --> 01:42:31.549
Retirement with full benefits.


01:42:32.322 --> 01:42:35.451
Yeah, the ultimate goal
of all civil servants.


01:42:36.493 --> 01:42:37.483
Let's not lose focus.


01:42:37.828 --> 01:42:40.423
I'll delay your resignation,
so come back soon.


01:42:51.575 --> 01:42:52.167
I'm off.


01:43:00.351 --> 01:43:04.618
Sir, make a border of the mound,
make it strong.


01:43:04.922 --> 01:43:05.719
So it can't be dug up.


01:43:07.258 --> 01:43:09.921
It's not a king's tomb,
no one will dig it up.


01:43:10.561 --> 01:43:12.291
Just make sure
it's strong and firm.


01:43:12.563 --> 01:43:14.725
Your mother raised
her children well.


01:43:15.433 --> 01:43:18.562
No one tends their parents'
graves this well nowadays.


01:43:20.238 --> 01:43:21.331
I've noticed you before.


01:43:21.906 --> 01:43:25.843
You're a good son,
a very good son.


01:43:29.380 --> 01:43:30.313
Feels nice? "Good son. "


01:43:32.483 --> 01:43:35.578
With you out of work,
how will we live now?


01:43:36.454 --> 01:43:37.251
What a life...


01:43:40.258 --> 01:43:42.793
- Young-chul.
- Yes?


01:43:43.461 --> 01:43:44.793
Used truck? Why?


01:43:47.632 --> 01:43:49.260
Toast shop you mentioned.


01:43:50.401 --> 01:43:51.835
We should start with a snack car.


01:43:52.904 --> 01:43:54.532
I'll talk to the chief about it,


01:43:55.873 --> 01:43:59.207
we can park in front of
the station and feed the unis.


01:43:59.710 --> 01:44:02.681
- Bro...
- Sir.


01:44:03.315 --> 01:44:04.840
How many dicks work at the station?


01:44:05.717 --> 01:44:07.345
- What?
- Officers, I mean.


01:44:09.755 --> 01:44:12.657
Probably around 370-380 in total?


01:44:14.359 --> 01:44:15.349
Let's see then.


01:44:15.694 --> 01:44:21.600
$1.50 per toast,
low estimate of 250,


01:44:21.652 --> 01:44:22.295
so in a day...


01:44:25.737 --> 01:44:26.636
How much?


01:44:26.805 --> 01:44:28.364
Dunno, I wasn't a math major.


01:44:28.474 --> 01:44:30.204
Come on!


01:44:31.610 --> 01:44:32.578
Let's pack up and go.


01:44:32.945 --> 01:44:33.776
Mina!


01:44:34.580 --> 01:44:36.674
Come up, say good bye
to grandma!


01:44:38.517 --> 01:44:40.281
- Come up!
- Okay!


01:44:44.623 --> 01:44:46.387
Say good bye to her.


01:44:46.892 --> 01:44:48.554
Good bye, grandma!


01:44:48.827 --> 01:44:49.590
I'll come again.


01:44:49.695 --> 01:44:51.357
Wipe your hands.
Toss that.


01:44:51.597 --> 01:44:52.826
Very good.


01:44:53.499 --> 01:44:54.990
Clean hands!


01:45:17.957 --> 01:45:21.860
PRIVATE PIGGY BANK


01:45:29.035 --> 01:45:30.367
Boss, we got a client.


01:45:37.777 --> 01:45:39.643
Check him.


01:45:40.980 --> 01:45:42.039
Okay.


01:45:50.490 --> 01:45:51.219
Key!


01:45:58.398 --> 01:45:59.331
It's ours.


01:45:59.699 --> 01:46:00.530
Then show him in.


01:46:02.870 --> 01:46:03.997
Shouldn't we check his ID?


01:46:04.338 --> 01:46:06.898
Boy, if we did,
we'd be out of business.


01:46:08.108 --> 01:46:10.304
- Withdrawing?
- Yes.


01:46:10.911 --> 01:46:12.379
- How much of it?
- Everything.


01:46:18.018 --> 01:46:20.647
I think the safe owner
gave you bad info.


01:46:21.021 --> 01:46:21.989
What?


01:46:26.694 --> 01:46:28.890
Enter the passcode inside.


01:47:22.817 --> 01:47:26.549
A HARD DAY


01:47:31.660 --> 01:47:36.564
FALLEN ANGEL

